views.innerHTML='<section id="aiView" class="mp-view" hidden><div class="mp-page"><div class="mp-head"><div><h2>Financial Assistant</h2><p>Ask research questions grounded in live public market data and the latest available macro readings.</p></div><span class="mp-chip">RESEARCH MODE</span></div><div class="mp-mentor"><div class="mp-avatar">'+avatar+'</div><div><h3>MarketPilot AI Financial Assistant</h3><p>Clear market context, cross-asset links and risk scenarios, grounded in available data.</p></div></div><form class="mp-chat-form mp-search-card" id="mpChatForm"><label class="mp-search-label" for="mpQuestion">ASK MARKETPILOT AI FINANCIAL ASSISTANT <span>· CROSS-ASSET RESEARCH</span></label><div class="mp-search-row"><span class="mp-search-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌕</span><input class="mp-input" id="mpQuestion" maxlength="1200" placeholder="Ask about the S&P 500, EUR/USD, gold, BTC…" required><button class="mp-button primary" id="mpSend" type="submit">Analyze ↗</button></div><p class="mp-search-hint">Try: “What could move gold this week?” or “Compare Nasdaq and Treasury yields.”</p></form><div class="mp-chat"><div class="mp-chat-head"><strong>MarketPilot AI Financial Assistant</strong><span style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px"><span id="mpChatState">Connecting AI…</span><button type="button" class="mp-clear-chat" id="mpClearChat">Clear chat</button></span></div><div class="mp-messages" id="mpMessages" aria-live="polite"><div class="mp-message"><small>MARKETPILOT AI ANALYST · RESEARCH</small>Ask a question or select a market below. I will separate available data from analysis and uncertainty.</div></div></div><div class="mp-title">Explore markets</div><div class="mp-market-tabs" id="mpMarketTabs"><button type="button" class="mp-market-tab active" data-group="crypto">Crypto</button><button type="button" class="mp-market-tab" data-group="stocks">US indices</button><button type="button" class="mp-market-tab" data-group="forex">Forex</button><button type="button" class="mp-market-tab" data-group="commodities">Commodities</button></div><div id="mpCrossAssetPanel" class="mp-cross-assets"><p class="mp-status">Loading market quotes…</p></div><div class="mp-prompts" id="mpPrompts" hidden><button class="mp-prompt" data-q="Give me a BTC and ETH market snapshot with latest prices and 24-hour changes.">BTC / ETH snapshot</button><button class="mp-prompt" data-q="Explain how US Treasury yields and the broad US dollar can affect Bitcoin and equities. Separate facts from interpretation.">Macro → risk assets</button><button class="mp-prompt" data-q="Compare BTC, ETH, SOL, BNB and XRP by latest 24-hour change and quote volume. Include source and timestamp.">Most traded crypto</button><button class="mp-prompt" data-q="Build a bull case, bear case and invalidation checklist for the asset I name. Avoid guaranteed targets.">Bull / bear scenarios</button><button class="mp-prompt" data-q="Teach me a repeatable market analysis framework using price, volume, volatility and macro context.">Teach me analysis</button></div><div id="mpAssetPrompts"></div><p class="mp-status" id="mpChatStatus">Connecting to MarketPilot AI service…</p><div class="mp-note">Research and education only—not personalized financial advice, trade execution or a guarantee of returns. API providers impose limits.</div></div></section><section id="researchView" class="mp-view" hidden><div class="mp-page"><div class="mp-head"><div><h2>Daily Market Briefing</h2><p>Review active assets, macro conditions and competing market scenarios in one daily workspace.</p></div><span class="mp-chip">DAILY WORKSPACE</span></div><div class="mp-grid"><article class="mp-card"><div class="mp-label">Research date</div><div class="mp-value" id="mpDate">—</div><div class="mp-muted">Market timestamps can differ from your local date.</div></article><article class="mp-card"><div class="mp-label">Coverage</div><div class="mp-value">Cross-asset</div><div class="mp-muted">Crypto, US indices, major FX pairs and key commodities.</div></article></div><div class="mp-row"><button class="mp-button primary" id="mpGenerate">Generate daily brief</button><button class="mp-button" id="mpRefresh">Refresh market data</button></div><p class="mp-status" id="mpResearchStatus">Loading market data…</p><div class="mp-title">Live crypto snapshot</div><div class="mp-assets" id="mpAssets"></div><div class="mp-title">US indices · Forex · Commodities</div><div id="mpResearchCrossAsset" class="mp-cross-assets"><p class="mp-status">Loading cross-asset quotes…</p></div><div class="mp-title">Research report</div><div class="mp-brief" id="mpBrief"><section><h3>01 / Market regime</h3><p>Generate a brief to review trend, volatility and macro context from available observations.</p></section><section><h3>02 / Bull case vs bear case</h3><p>Separate evidence, assumptions and invalidation conditions.</p></section><section><h3>03 / Watchlist & events</h3><p>Verify market timestamps and upcoming economic releases from authoritative sources.</p></section></div><div class="mp-note">Briefs are on-demand in this first phase. Scheduled reports and cloud history need deployed services and database configuration.</div></div></section><section id="profileView" class="mp-view" hidden><div class="mp-page mp-profile"><div class="mp-head"><div><h2>Profile & Workspace</h2><p>Set analyst preferences for this device.</p></div><span class="mp-chip">WORKSPACE</span></div><div class="mp-card"><div class="mp-label">Current workspace</div><div class="mp-value" id="mpProfileTitle">Local workspace</div><label for="mpName">Display name</label><input class="mp-input" id="mpName" maxlength="60" placeholder="Your analyst name"><label for="mpLevel">Experience level</label><select class="mp-select" id="mpLevel"><option value="beginner">Beginner</option><option value="intermediate">Intermediate</option><option value="advanced">Advanced</option></select><label for="mpFocus">Primary market focus</label><select class="mp-select" id="mpFocus"><option value="crypto">Crypto</option><option value="macro">Macro / rates / dollar</option><option value="equities">Stocks & indices</option><option value="multi">Multi-asset</option></select><label for="mpLanguage">Preferred language</label><select class="mp-select" id="mpLanguage"><option>English</option><option>Roman Urdu</option><option>Urdu</option></select><div class="mp-row"><button class="mp-button primary" id="mpSaveProfile">Save preferences</button><button class="mp-button" id="mpExport">Export preferences</button></div><p class="mp-status" id="mpProfileStatus">Stored locally in this browser. This is not a login.</p></div><div class="mp-title">Secure sign-in</div><div class="mp-card"><strong style="font-size:12px">Secure sign-in is not enabled yet</strong><p class="mp-muted">This profile is saved only on this device. Real sign-in and cloud profiles need an identity provider and database setup. Do not enter a password here.</p><div class="mp-chip">Supabase Auth candidate</div> <div class="mp-chip">SQL database</div></div><div class="mp-title">AI service</div><div class="mp-card"><div class="mp-label">AI provider</div><div class="mp-value" style="font-size:13px" id="mpBackend">MarketPilot AI endpoint checking…</div><p class="mp-muted">Market data, history and news continue to use the existing Worker. AI answers use the configured AI endpoint. Provider limits apply; API keys never belong in frontend files.</p></div></div></section>';

